hifiberry-pipewire-configs (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of HiFiBerry PipeWire configuration package
  * Added 90-hifiberry-effects.conf with advanced audio processing:
    - 16-band parametric EQ for left and right channels
    - Balance control with crossfeed capabilities
    - Mono/stereo conversion options
    - Virtual sink for audio effects processing
  * Added 99-hifiberry-headless.conf for headless systems:
    - Disables D-Bus session dependencies
    - Disables X11 bell module
    - Optimized for embedded and server environments
  * Extracted from legacy pipewire package for modular installation

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Wed, 01 Oct 2025 16:00:00 +0000